It is a sunny morning in May.
I ride my bike to the office.
Jonas and I are early.
Our team lead Katrin calls us into a meeting room.
“Good morning, you two,” says Katrin.
“The new client project has officially started!”
Jonas and I smile.
“I have been the team lead here for three years,” she explains.
“And this is our most important client yet.”
“Maya, I am glad that you are working directly with us on this project.”
“Thank you, I am really looking forward to it,” I reply.
“We are working closely together as a team,” says Katrin.
She opens the laptop and shows us the plan.
“I have already planned the first tasks.”
The atmosphere is focused but very friendly.
I am ready for the work.
